/* <orly/code_gen/variant_parity_test/parity.orly>

   The package whose generated headers are frozen in this directory for
   orly/code_gen/variant_parity.test.cc. Compile it with orlyc (from a
   directory outside the repo) and copy V15...h, V2i4LeafLX04Node.h,
   V2i1AO01B.h and O2i1ns4name.h from orly/rt/objects to par, leaf, inner
   and rec.frozen.h, keeping each file's leading comment and redirecting
   its <orly/rt/objects/*.h> includes to the frozen copies.

